  "articles": [
    {
      "id": "r20261121-a01",
      "title": "A Rainy Morning",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "On Monday morning, Putri woke up and heard the rain. It was heavy, and the street in front of her house was already full of water. \"How will I get to school?\" she asked her father.",
        "Father smiled and opened the closet. He took out her yellow raincoat and her small red umbrella. \"The rain will not stop you today,\" he said. They walked to school together, and Putri jumped over every puddle on the way.",
        "At the school gate, her teacher was waiting with a towel. \"Come in and dry your feet,\" she said. Putri was wet, cold, and very happy. Rainy mornings were her favorite."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "woke up": "bangun",
        "heavy": "deras",
        "closet": "lemari",
        "raincoat": "jas hujan",
        "umbrella": "payung",
